    "Borra comidas, journal y scores guardados; activa los mocks de todos los features; rellena un perfil demo (Sara, despertar 7:00, sueno 8.0 h) y te lleva al onboarding para verlo desde cero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It erases food, journal and stored scores; it activates the mocks of all features; it fills a demo profile (Sara, wake up 7: 00, sleep 8.0 h) and takes you to the onboard to see it from scratch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Borra comidas, journal y scores; activa datos mock para todos los features; rellena un perfil demo (Sara, 7:00, 8.0 h) y te lleva al onboarding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It erases meals, journal and scores; it activates mock data for all features; it fills a demo profile (Sara, 7: 00, 8.0 h) and takes you to the onboarding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Borra todos los datos locales de Recvel (SwiftData, preferencias, agenda, mocks, API key y notificaciones) y vuelve al onboarding como una instalacion nueva. No revoca permisos de Apple Health.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete all local Recvel data (SwiftData, preferences, agenda, mocks, key API and notifications) and return to onboarding as a new installation. He doesn't revoke Apple Health's permissions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
