    },
    "El ayuno no es seguro para todas las personas. Responde con honestidad; tus respuestas se quedan en tu dispositivo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fasting is not safe for all people. Answer honestly; your answers stay on your device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El ayuno no se recomienda para ti": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fasting is not recommended for you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El banco necesita 3 noches medidas · llevas %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bench needs 3 measured nights · you have %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El cien": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hundred"
          }
        },
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cien"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El enfoque y la Carga de hoy consideran tu Recuperación. El plan nocturno combina necesidad base, deuda reciente y Carga; la hora sugerida se aproxima a ciclos de 90 min y contempla 15 min para conciliar el sueño. La rutina previa es opcional. Nutrición cuenta días con comidas registradas y Calma considera mindfulness o un registro emocional. Son estimaciones de bienestar, no indicaciones clínicas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's focus and Load take your Recovery into account. The night plan combines base need, recent debt and Load; the suggested time approximates 90-min cycles and allows 15 min to fall asleep. The wind-down routine is optional. Nutrition counts days with logged meals and Calm considers mindfulness or an emotional entry. These are wellness estimates, not clinical guidance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El enfoque y la carga de hoy salen de tu Recovery. La noche combina base, deuda reciente y strain; la hora de cama se alinea al conteo de ciclos (~90 min) mas cercano a esa necesidad, mas ~15 min para dormirte. La rutina previa es opcional (wind-down tipico 30-60 min). Nutricion cuenta dias con comida registrada (cerca de tu meta si tienes perfil). Calma cuenta meditacion Si o un check-in emocional. Estimaciones de bienestar, no prescripcion clinica.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Today's focus and Load comes out of your Recovery. The night combines base, recent debt and strain; the bedtime is aligned to the nearest cycle count (~ 90 min), plus ~ 15 min to sleep. The previous routine is optional (typical wind-down 30-60 min). Nutrition has days of registered food (near your goal if you have a profile). Easy counts meditation Yes or an emotional check- in. Welfare estimates, not clinical prescription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El rango combina tu Recovery actual con la carga reciente. Mejora al reunir dias comparables; no es una cuota que debas alcanzar si no te sientes bien.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The range combines your current Recovery with the recent load. Improvement by gathering comparable days; it is not a quota you should reach if you do not feel well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El rango combina tu Recuperación actual con la carga reciente. Mejora al reunir días comparables; no es una cuota que debas alcanzar si no te sientes bien.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The range combines your current Recovery with recent load. It improves as comparable days add up; it isn't a quota you must hit if you don't feel well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El resto seran dias de descanso en tu agenda.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rest will be rest days on your schedule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El resumen de actividad y la respuesta a la Carga permanecen visibles porque dan contexto a tu entrenamiento.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The activity summary and the response to Load stay visible because they give context to your training."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El volumen de pliometría se mide en contactos; 40-80 es un rango habitual por sesión.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plyometric volume is measured in contacts; 40-80 is a common range per session."
