    "La carga prevista usa sRPE (minutos × RPE). Recvel ajusta consejos según tu respuesta real; nunca sustituye la valoración de un profesional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projected load uses sRPE (minutes × RPE). Recvel adjusts advice based on your actual response; it never replaces a professional's assessment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La descripcion y, si existe, la foto saldran de este dispositivo hacia Gemini. El resultado seguira siendo editable antes de guardarse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The description and, if it exists, the photo will leave this device for Gemini. The result will remain editable before being saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La experiencia y el objetivo cambian cómo se presenta la carga; nada se impone automáticamente.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Experience and goal change how load is presented; nothing is imposed automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La fase da contexto a tus semanas y facilita programar descargas o una competencia.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phase gives context to your weeks and makes it easier to schedule deloads or a competition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La sesion se guarda en Apple Health y Recvel la incorpora al Strain.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The session is held in Apple Health and is incorporated into the Load."
