        }
      }
    },
    "Laboratorio": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laboratory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las calorias son un rango asistido. Revisa porciones, aceites y bebidas antes de guardar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calories are an assisted range. Check portions, oils and drinks before saving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las cargas son estimaciones de bienestar basadas en duracion, zonas de frecuencia cardiaca y tu baseline. No predicen lesiones ni sustituyen una evaluacion profesional.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The loads are well-being estimates based on duration, heart rate areas and your baseline. They do not predict injuries or replace a professional evaluation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las diferencias son asociaciones locales y no prueban causalidad. Solo aparecen con al menos 5 registros Sí y 5 No vinculados a la Recuperación del mismo día. Un dato sin registrar permanece como desconocido.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Differences are local associations and don't prove causation. They only appear with at least 5 Yes entries and 5 No entries linked to the same day's Recovery. Unlogged data stays unknown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las diferencias son asociaciones locales, no prueban causalidad. Se muestran solo con al menos 5 Si y 5 No unidos a Recovery del mismo dia. Un dato sin registrar queda como desconocido, no como No.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The differences are local associations, they do not prove causality. They are shown only with at least 5 Yes and 5 Not attached to Recovery of the same day. An unrecorded data is as unknown, not as No."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las fases son estimaciones poblacionales aproximadas, no una medicion de tu cuerpo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phases are approximate population estimates, not a measurement of your body."
