            "value": "It's been %@ since your last fast."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Llevas %lld %@ hoy · el promedio del día aparece a partir de %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Llevas %1$lld %2$@ hoy · el promedio del día aparece a partir de %3$lld"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %1$lld %2$@ today · the daily average appears from %3$lld on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que mas mueve el VO2 max en la literatura es el entrenamiento interválico de alta intensidad combinado con volumen aeróbico constante. Los cambios se miden en meses, no en semanas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What moves VO2 max most in literature is high-intensity intervalidating training combined with constant aerobic volume. The changes are measured in months, not weeks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que registraste hoy, las asociaciones que empiezan a aparecer y tu siguiente paso.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you recorded today, the associations that start to appear and your next step."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locales en este dispositivo. Puedes apagarlos cuando quieras.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premises on this device. You can turn them off any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los ciclos (~90 min) son una heuristica para planear; la duracion real varia entre personas y noches. No es consejo medico.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cycles (~90 min) are a planning heuristic; actual duration varies between people and nights. This is not medical advice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los nueve analitos deben pertenecer a un panel reciente. Recvel nunca completa valores faltantes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The nine analites must belong to a recent panel. Recvel never completes missing values."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los pasos y la energia activa siguen aportando a tu carga diaria.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The steps and active energy continue to contribute to your daily load."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los patrones comparan dias con Si y No. Son asociaciones locales, no prueban causa. Recvel espera al menos 5 registros de cada grupo antes de mostrar una diferencia.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The patterns compare days with Yes and No. They're local associations, they don't prove cause. Recvel expects at least 5 records from each group before showing a difference."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los patrones comparan días con respuestas Sí y No. Son asociaciones locales y no demuestran causalidad. Recvel necesita al menos 5 registros de cada grupo antes de mostrar una diferencia.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Patterns compare days with Yes and No answers. They are local associations and don't prove causation. Recvel needs at least 5 entries in each group before showing a difference."
          }
        }
      }
    },
